{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter an experimental second-person escape room horror experience that's almost as soul-crushing as the corporate world. You will be challenged to figure out the world around you by activating cameras and piecing together clues within an office dungeon environment. Your spatial reasoning will be put to the test as you watch tapes and solve intricate and spooky puzzles. How far are you willing to go for a job?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424620/extras/Gameplay_Gif.gif?t=1746912640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do Your Job</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The manager seems pretty nosy but not very helpful. Not much different from your last three jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424620/extras/Manager_Clip.gif?t=1746912640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't Die</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timers? Flashing red lights? What kind of job is this?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424620/extras/Losing_Clip.gif?t=1746912640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Second-person:</strong>\u00a0Take control of characters who are being watched by another character who you also control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 Cameras:</strong>\u00a0Look at 9 TV screens from various angles to piece together the world and make your way to the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tank Controls:</strong> Go back to the good ol' days of rotating instead of strafing to move about the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Puzzles:</strong> Work your way through a wide variety of unique puzzles by activating cameras and unlocking new perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Corporate Narrative:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy a suspenseful story filled dark humor and eerie themes about working in the corporate world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424620?t=1746912640","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746912640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424620/09fda0433d09a9b787c322e8a6600e07e6807632/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746912640","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424620/09fda0433d09a9b787c322e8a6600e07e6807632/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746912640","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Levels contain blood and your character may die if failing a challenge."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3459410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter an experimental second-person escape room horror experience that's almost as soul-crushing as the corporate world. You will be challenged to figure out the world around you by activating cameras and piecing together clues within an office dungeon environment. Your spatial reasoning will be put to the test as you watch tapes and solve intricate and spooky puzzles. How far are you willing to go for a job?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424620/extras/Gameplay_Gif.gif?t=1746912640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do Your Job</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ma